#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:24
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt15Intro"
msgid ""
"I don't have a bone to pick with you.\n"
"I'm just following orders!$"
msgstr "我跟你无冤无仇。我只是奉命行事而已！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:28
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt15Defeat"
msgid "I may have lost, but…$"
msgstr "我也许是输了，但是……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt15PostBattle"
msgid ""
"We dug up something beyond belief!\n"
"And, we got the BLUE ORB!\p"
"All that's left is for our leader to…\n"
"Fufufu… Fwahahaha!$"
msgstr ""
"我们挖出了难以置信的东西！\n"
"而且，我们拿到了靛蓝色宝珠！\p"
"接下来只要首领……\n"
"呼呼呼……哇哈哈哈！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt6Intro"
msgid ""
"I can't stand heat. Maybe I should've\n"
"joined TEAM AQUA instead…$"
msgstr ""
"我受不了热。\n"
"也许我当初应该加入海洋队才对……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt6Defeat"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I really may not be right for\n"
"TEAM MAGMA…$"
msgstr "是啊，我可能真的不适合熔岩队……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:45
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt6PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Don't you get lonely for the sea\n"
"being in a place like this?$"
msgstr "待在这种地方，你不会想念大海吗？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt7Intro"
msgid ""
"You can hear tremors here sometimes.\p"
"Could it be the volcano rattling?\n"
"Or is it GROU…\p"
"Whoops!\n"
"No, no, never mind!$"
msgstr ""
"在这里有时候能听到震动声。\p"
"是火山在晃动吗？还是固拉……\p"
"哎呀！不不，没什么！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt7Defeat"
msgid ""
"You're a fiery battler.\n"
"Just like a volcano!$"
msgstr "你真是个火热的对手。就像火山一样！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt7PostBattle"
msgid ""
"You just happened to win this time,\n"
"but that doesn't matter.\p"
"TEAM MAGMA's goal is about to be\n"
"reached!$"
msgstr ""
"你这次只是碰巧赢了，不过无所谓。\p"
"熔岩队的目标马上就要实现了！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:66
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt8Intro"
msgid ""
"One of our guys was freaking out that\n"
"he lost his MAGMA EMBLEM…\p"
"Wait a minute!\n"
"Was it you who found it?$"
msgstr ""
"我们有个家伙因为弄丢了熔岩队徽章，\n"
"急得要命……\p"
"等一下！难道是你捡到的？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:72
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt8Defeat"
msgid "I'm having trouble believing this…$"
msgstr "真让人难以相信……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_2R/scripts.inc:75
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_2R_Text_Grunt8PostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm getting this feeling that our plan\n"
"is going to end in failure…$"
msgstr ""
"我有种预感，\n"
"我们的计划会以失败告终……$"
